t": 220, "text": "Where words are acrobats, imagination unfurled."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Let yourself be swept by my light and carefree pen,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "In this dance of ambiguity, I\u2019m the magician of the den."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}